{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 36,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        231.10589599609375,
        21.884788513183594,
        277.722412109375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        277.722412109375,
        21.884788513183594,
        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.188232421875,
        513.4030151367188,
        96.53973388671875
      ],
      "text": "Two academic resource persons, under the guidance of the Steering Committee, were",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        99.18475341796875,
        513.3915405273438,
        112.5362548828125
      ],
      "text": "selected to conduct a systematic review of literature published since January 2010 or",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.1812744140625,
        513.4606323242188,
        128.53277587890625
      ],
      "text": "subsequent to the above-listed WHO guidelines and policy documents. Using PubMed",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.17779541015625,
        513.3800048828125,
        144.529296875
      ],
      "text": "and MEDLINE, they searched for studies from low- and middle-income countries in all",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        147.17431640625,
        513.3916015625,
        160.52581787109375
      ],
      "text": "WHO regions as well as from more standard literature sources. Relevant studies up to July",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        163.17083740234375,
        513.46044921875,
        176.5223388671875
      ],
      "text": "2012 were identified using a combination of search terms (tuberculosis; child; paediatrics;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        179.1673583984375,
        513.4605712890625,
        192.51885986328125
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis; IGRA; Xpert; molecular diagnostic techniques; prevention; therapeutics;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        195.16387939453125,
        513.4488525390625,
        208.515380859375
      ],
      "text": "rifampin or rifampicin; isoniazid; pyrazinamide; ethambutol; streptomycin; vaccine;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        211.160400390625,
        513.3914184570312,
        224.51190185546875
      ],
      "text": "BCG; prevention; HIV; antiretroviral; screening; multidrug-resistant). These search terms",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        227.15692138671875,
        513.4605102539062,
        240.5084228515625
      ],
      "text": "were used in a range of sensitive and specific combinations. Reference lists of retrieved",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        243.1534423828125,
        474.6134948730469,
        256.50494384765625
      ],
      "text": "studies were also reviewed to identify new studies related to recommendations.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        267.65997314453125,
        513.40283203125,
        281.011474609375
      ],
      "text": "For each recommendation, a summary of any recent evidence was prepared, followed",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        283.656494140625,
        513.4375,
        297.00799560546875
      ],
      "text": "by a description of the benefits, harms and other considerations that could be of use",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        299.65301513671875,
        333.19793701171875,
        313.0045166015625
      ],
      "text": "while reviewing and grading the recommendation.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        324.1595153808594,
        513.4259643554688,
        337.5110168457031
      ],
      "text": "For systematic reviews and meta-analyses of diagnostic approaches, QUADAS assessment",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        340.156005859375,
        513.471923828125,
        353.50750732421875
      ],
      "text": "was used to assess the quality of the recent evidence. The quality of recent evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        356.1524963378906,
        513.403076171875,
        369.5039978027344
      ],
      "text": "from diagnostic evaluation studies was assessed using STARD, and for case-control and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        372.14898681640625,
        472.255859375,
        385.50048828125
      ],
      "text": "cohort studies, a modified version of the Newcastle-Ottawa Scale was applied.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        396.6554870605469,
        513.4605102539062,
        410.0069885253906
      ],
      "text": "A Guidelines Development Group - the Panel - which included the Chair of the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        412.6519775390625,
        513.4720458984375,
        426.00347900390625
      ],
      "text": "Childhood TB subgroup of the Stop TB Partnership, paediatricians, NTP managers and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        428.6484680175781,
        513.448974609375,
        441.9999694824219
      ],
      "text": "pharmacologists was established to synthesize and evaluate the evidence underlying the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        444.64495849609375,
        513.448974609375,
        457.9964599609375
      ],
      "text": "recommendations that were considered for possible revision. Declarations of Interest",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        460.6414489746094,
        513.3799438476562,
        473.9929504394531
      ],
      "text": "were collected and reviewed before appointments to the Panel were made; it was",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        476.637939453125,
        513.4375610351562,
        489.98944091796875
      ],
      "text": "also made clear that any changes during the development of the guidance that might",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        492.6344299316406,
        513.4259033203125,
        505.9859313964844
      ],
      "text": "be considered a source of potential conflict of interest needed to be reported to the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        508.63092041015625,
        141.67691040039062,
        521.982421875
      ],
      "text": "secretariat.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        533.1373901367188,
        513.4605102539062,
        546.4888916015625
      ],
      "text": "A face-to-face meeting of the Panel, chaired by a methodologist, took place on 17-19",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        549.1339111328125,
        513.3916015625,
        562.4854125976562
      ],
      "text": "July 2012. All Panel members presented their Declarations of Interests; no significant",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        565.1304321289062,
        479.96099853515625,
        578.48193359375
      ],
      "text": "conflicts of interest were identified (see “Funding and Declarations of Interest”).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        589.6369018554688,
        513.448974609375,
        602.9884033203125
      ],
      "text": "Results of the systematic reviews were presented during the meeting. Panel members",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        605.6334228515625,
        513.41455078125,
        618.9849243164062
      ],
      "text": "evaluated any evidence that had become available since the publication of each",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        621.6299438476562,
        513.4373779296875,
        634.9814453125
      ],
      "text": "recommendation. Evaluation was based on the quality of the recent evidence, patient",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        637.6264038085938,
        513.4376220703125,
        650.9779052734375
      ],
      "text": "values and preferences, and cost, as well as on judgements of trade-offs between",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        653.6229248046875,
        513.4375610351562,
        666.9744262695312
      ],
      "text": "benefits and harms. Finally, the recommendations were either accepted unchanged or",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        669.6194458007812,
        125.0823974609375,
        682.970947265625
      ],
      "text": "revised.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        694.1259155273438,
        513.4833984375,
        707.4774169921875
      ],
      "text": "During this process of synthesis, the Panel members were assisted by the academic",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        710.1224365234375,
        513.4146118164062,
        723.4739379882812
      ],
      "text": "resource persons who, however, had no voting rights. The Panel agreed that there",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        726.1189575195312,
        513.4719848632812,
        739.470458984375
      ],
      "text": "were no new additional questions to be reviewed for the development of new",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        742.1154174804688,
        176.1998748779297,
        755.4669189453125
      ],
      "text": "recommendations.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        766.6219482421875,
        513.4489135742188,
        779.9734497070312
      ],
      "text": "The GRADE process was used to assess the quality of the evidence and the strength of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        782.618408203125,
        198.5673828125,
        795.9699096679688
      ],
      "text": "the recommendations.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "17",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}